          "src": "https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hphu8zlu/production/a9f72a09f1f1be7b360d9ca77993d74d1a1a8edb-1672x941.webp?w=1600&fit=max&auto=format",
          "alt": "Early signs of pregnancy: what to look for and when",
